17
00:01:17,105 --> 00:01:19,912
It also refined its
policy-level and practical

18
00:01:19,912 --> 00:01:22,169
recommendations to make them clearer.

19
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:26,640
For example, developing provincial
water data centres, assigning

20
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:30,618
responsible agencies, revising
laws and regulations, using

21
00:01:30,618 --> 00:01:34,459
